rd runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. March to April came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, November to December ran 23% of normal on the middle of the grids, and March to April ran 30%. Every grid had its driest year in 2006, with grid 11294 at 60%.</p>"}
